{"type":"example","type_name":"Example","number":"","title":"Five wood adhesives on six boards","title_html":"Five wood adhesives on six boards","html":"<p>In a synthetic experiment, five adhesives are compared for the shear\nstrength of glued joints. Timber varies from board to board, so each of\nsix boards is cut into five strips, assigned to the adhesives by a\nrandom permutation. The strengths (MPa) are:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"header\">\n<th>adhesive</th>\n<th>board 1</th>\n<th>board 2</th>\n<th>board 3</th>\n<th>board 4</th>\n<th>board 5</th>\n<th>board 6</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td>1</td>\n<td>7.89</td>\n<td>8.42</td>\n<td>8.55</td>\n<td>8.30</td>\n<td>9.26</td>\n<td>9.15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"even\">\n<td>2</td>\n<td>8.68</td>\n<td>8.69</td>\n<td>8.73</td>\n<td>8.62</td>\n<td>9.72</td>\n<td>9.51</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td>3</td>\n<td>9.13</td>\n<td>9.28</td>\n<td>9.81</td>\n<td>9.43</td>\n<td>10.30</td>\n<td>9.41</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"even\">\n<td>4</td>\n<td>8.48</td>\n<td>8.60</td>\n<td>8.46</td>\n<td>8.95</td>\n<td>9.42</td>\n<td>9.02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td>5</td>\n<td>8.90</td>\n<td>9.17</td>\n<td>9.79</td>\n<td>9.57</td>\n<td>10.24</td>\n<td>9.09</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The analysis of variance is:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"header\">\n<th>source</th>\n<th>df</th>\n<th>sum of squares</th>\n<th>mean square</th>\n<th><span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"F\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D439 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td>adhesives</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td><span class=\"math inline\">